{
  "id": "plugin01",
  "domain": "plugin-targets",
  "route": "R25",
  "target_type": "Chrome/Edge MV3 浏览器扩展（.crx，本地授权样本）",
  "authority": "local",
  "goal_level": "L2",
  "outcome": "planned",
  "package": {
    "file": "evidence/extension.crx",
    "sha256": "",
    "version": "2.3.1",
    "manifest_version": 3,
    "source": "本地旁加载/商店导出"
  },
  "manifest": {
    "permissions": ["storage", "cookies", "scripting", "nativeMessaging"],
    "host_permissions": ["https://*.example.invalid/*"],
    "background": {"service_worker": "background.js"},
    "content_scripts": [
      {"matches": ["https://*.example.invalid/*"], "js": ["content.js"], "run_at": "document_idle", "world": "ISOLATED"}
    ],
    "web_accessible_resources": [{"resources": ["inject.js"], "matches": ["https://*.example.invalid/*"]}],
    "externally_connectable": {"matches": ["https://portal.example.invalid/*"]}
  },
  "entrypoints": {
    "manifest": "manifest.json",
    "background": "background.js",
    "content_script": "content.js",
    "native_host": "com.example.bridge"
  },
  "data_flow": [
    "page → content.js → chrome.runtime.sendMessage → background.js",
    "background.js → chrome.cookies/scripting → page",
    "background.js → connectNative → 本机 host"
  ],
  "artifacts": [
    {"path": "evidence/extension.crx", "sha256": ""},
    {"path": "export/manifest.json", "sha256": ""},
    {"path": "report/dataflow.md", "sha256": ""}
  ],
  "lessons": [
    "先解释每个权限对应哪条代码路径，再谈恶意；nativeMessaging 是高价值面",
    "content script 默认 isolated world，只有 world=MAIN 或注入 script 才进页面上下文",
    "MV3 service worker 会被回收，动态观测要主动唤醒并记录消息",
    "失败判据：权限/入口无法对应代码路径，或签名/企业策略阻止加载"
  ],
  "tags": ["R25", "plugin", "crx", "mv3", "nativeMessaging"],
  "refs": [
    "Tool/skill/plugin-targets/SKILL.md",
    "Tool/skill/plugin-targets/references/browser-extension.md",
    "Tool/skill/plugin-targets/references/electron-and-asar.md"
  ],
  "updated": "2026-10-20"
}
